{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47740","headline":"垄穴遗诗 · 沈廷瑞","name":"垄穴遗诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚劳营殡玉山前，殡後那知已脱蝉。\n应是元神归洞府，更无遗魄在黄泉。\n灵台已得修真诀，尘世空留悟道篇。\n堪叹浮生今古事，北邙山下草芊芊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈廷瑞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}